// Not allowed: an unadjusted Langevin move, then a Metropolis-Hastings move on
// the same parameter using the same factors. The unadjusted move does not
// evaluate factors, so the MH move's acceptance ratio would read unevaluated
// values; make_mcmc stops with an error.

/***unadjusted_proposal,ilike::langevin(theta,1,0.5)***/

/***imh_proposal,ilike::norm(theta,1,0.7071068)***/

/***mcmc_termination,ilike::iterations(10000)***/
